== Solution ==
<!-- 
The only solution is to replace the membrane switch with a tactile switch
The foot print of the tactile switch is a little bigger so you have to bend the legs up on the tactile switch 
I bought the following specification tactile switches that work well 
3x3x1.5mm

DO NOT use a lot of heat on this board
Tin the legs with solder 

The foam gasket will not sit as it used to but if you want you can put it over the switch or what I did is cut some packaging foam 

When soldering the new swatch I put a dot of glue in the middle to give it some strength
When screwing the board back make sure not to overtighten as the screws strip easily and the button might be pressed in always



-->



